{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116300","id":3285834549,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7D2ds1","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116300","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116300.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116300.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116300","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116300/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116300/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116300/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/747e5fb99fbe9b26d9acbb7f9ae0f93b92525f20","number":116300,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"C#: Optimize C++ to .NET calls with delegate* and hash map lookup","user":{"login":"neikeq","id":7718100,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MTgxMDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7718100?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq","html_url":"https://github.com/neikeq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #89217 (there may be more issues like this one)\r\n\r\nThis should bring the call speed in line with Godot 3.x, if not better.\r\n\r\nI was very cautious to not accidentally introduce a change in behavior that could cause regressions, but there's still a chance I might have missed something.\r\n\r\nWe still fallback to the old, slower call logic if we detect that a script class overrides the related method. This is for backwards compatibility.\r\n\r\nI included a first commit (will squash later) that was using `delegate* unmanaged` instead of `delegate* managed`, in case anyone is interested in comparing them. But that one doesn't support generic classes. The speed difference is minimal. If you're going to try both, you must delete the `res://.godot/mono/` folder in between, or it will crash.\r\n\r\nIt may be worth comparing against #89826 (it uses delegates so it should be slower) and https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/89217#issuecomment-3871150214 (it may depend on which is faster between .NET's Dictionary and Godot's AHashMap).\r\n\r\n### Results for #89217 (test_mono_method_cache)\r\n\r\nResults are in [this comment](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116300#issuecomment-5690451443).\r\n\r\n### Results for #115960 (PerformanceTestMRP_Godot4.5)\r\n\r\nI'm confused about this MRP. It mentions the FPS drop when going from 100 buttons to 300, but this doesn't seem to be C# related.\r\nI edited the MRP to add a shortcut for 300 buttons without script, and I notice no difference.\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>100 buttons</summary>\r\n<img width=\"1150\" height=\"648\" alt=\"no script 100\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c9941fdf-c4ba-4a2f-b5cd-68af4637bfc7\" />\r\n<img width=\"1150\" height=\"648\" alt=\"script 100\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/164c30d8-9509-4ae6-9a5c-e80ba4b8b901\" />\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>300 buttons</summary>\r\n<img width=\"1097\" height=\"617\" alt=\"no script 300\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a0045158-7b26-4932-b78f-a7d8128525bc\" />\r\n<img width=\"1097\" height=\"617\" alt=\"script 300\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7ed574ab-7bb6-4a34-9402-162b64f0374f\" />\r\n</details>\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/